Use DataDict.pkg

Open OidcRevokedRefreshToken
Open OidcClient

Class cOidcRevokedRefreshTokenDataDictionary is a DataDictionary
    
    Procedure Construct_Object
        Forward Send Construct_Object
        Set Main_File to OidcRevokedRefreshToken.File_Number

        Set Add_Server_File to OidcClient.File_Number

        Set Foreign_Field_Option DD_KEYFIELD DD_NOPUT to True
        Set Foreign_Field_Option DD_KEYFIELD DD_FINDREQ to True
        Set Foreign_Field_Option DD_INDEXFIELD DD_NOPUT to True
        Set Foreign_Field_Option DD_DEFAULT DD_DISPLAYONLY to True

    End_Procedure
    
    Procedure Field_Defaults
        Forward Send Field_Defaults
        Set Field_Changed_Value Field OidcRevokedRefreshToken.Used to 0
        Set Field_Changed_Value Field OidcRevokedRefreshToken.Revoked to 0
    End_Procedure
End_Class